						],
						"pointId": 69
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790540101,
					"content": "Why are you up here yourself? There isn't even a rail line here, and it's way high up at the very edge of the Mirage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540102,
					"content": "People rarely come here. Even Idyia... Heh, I doubt she even knows this place exists.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540103,
					"content": "So if there's nothing here, why are you here, Jeroney?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540104,
					"content": "I just came out for a little fresh air... Hey, don't give me that \"you ran away from home after arguing with Ferdinand again\" look!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540105,
					"content": "Come on, there really wasn't an argument. I'm just taking a stroll out of, well, I don't know, personal interest!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540106,
					"content": "I suppose you already knew that the Choo-Choo Cart was my idea. At that time, I was only thinking: What's something that could easily reach great heights...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540107,
					"content": "So I... So Jeroney brainstormed the Choo-Choo Cart and the rails, all for the love of the sky and heights.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540108,
					"content": "Sounds silly, doesn't it? I remember Inazuma has a saying that goes something like, \"only idiots and smoke like to rise up high\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540109,
						790540110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540109,
					"content": "It's awesome that you could think up the Choo-Choo Cart.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790540111,
					"content": "But it can only exist in the Veluriyam Mirage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540112,
					"content": "...Forget it, let's not talk about it. I also came here to stargaze.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540113,
					"content": "I know the stars here are merely an ephemeral shadow from outside the Mirage, but they're pretty enough for me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540114,
					"content": "Every night when I look upon the starry sky... I feel so peaceful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540115,
					"content": "The one who loves the starry sky... is it Jeroney...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790540116,
					"content": "But whoever sees a starry sky like that couldn't help but fall in love with it. If only I could see the stars in the daytime...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540117,
					"content": "Or even better, if I didn't have to climb up here every day!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540118,
					"content": "Wait! That's possible! Paimon's got an idea!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540119,
					"content": "Huh? Really?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540120,
					"content": "We can just take a photo...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790540121,
					"content": "Pho... Photo? That sounds like some advanced technology.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540122,
					"content": "Yeah, why don't we take a photo of the starry sky for Jeroney?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540123,
					"content": "Can you really do that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540124,
					"content": "Of course you can!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790540125,
					"content": "But... Paimon isn't sure of any good spots to take pictures of the starry night...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540126,
					"content": "Here! At night, on the platform here, you can see the most beautiful starscape! That's the reason I came here in the first place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jeroney"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540127,
					"content": "Really? Great! Jeroney, you just wait for our photo!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790540110,
					"content": "I think it is so much fun.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790540111
					]
				}
			]
		},
